! U. Burke, W. J. Pitz and H. J. Curran, 
! "Experimental and kinetic modeling study of the shock tube ignition of a large oxygenated fuel: 
! Tri-propylene glycol mono-methyl ether," 
! Combustion and Flame, Submitted (2014) 
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1q: 2014-10-14
! WJP: removed duplicate species from list: c5h6, hocho, ch3coch2, dpgcc*c, pgcc*c, dpgme,
! cocc2oh, tc3h5och3, hoc*cc*o, ch3cocho
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1p
! Used Yasunaga et al. CnF2011 rate tpgme-8 => pgcc*c + cocc2oj
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1o
! Increased Ea of cocc2oj + pgcc*c = tpgme-8             1.0e11   0.0  -1000.0
! by 7.3 kcal to get 1975LIS/MAS625 rate of ch3o+c2h4=ch3oc2h4 at 400K
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1n:
! Put reasonable rate constant in 1st line of PLOG rate so that LLNL sensitivity solver does not fail:
! c3h6+oh reactions, put in 10 atm rate constant in first line next to reaction name
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1m:
! WJP 2013-12-03: added some comments to rxns
! UB 1-12-13, c3h5oh = ac3h5oh, propenol mech added was removed and species only considered = ac3h5oh
! UB 1-12-13, c3h6oh (gamma propanol radical) has no consumption pathways except o2 addition, new ones were added
! UB 30-11-13, propenol mech added, incl. therm update for c3h5oh, ch2cch2oh, ch2chchoh
! UB 29-11-13, Any multi product reactions now defined as irreversible
! tpgme_mech_low-highT_v1k:
! Added NUIG Aramco mech version 56.43 as the C1C4 base chemistry
! WJP: Uses RO2 isomerization rate constants from iso-alkane work, Sarathy, 2013
!version:  aramcomech 1.3 c4
!authors:  w. k. metcalfe, s. burke, h. j. curran
!website: http://c3.nuigalway.ie/

