!tpgme-8 => pgcc*c + ch2o + ch3cho + ch3           1.60e+13 0.00  2.542e+04 !anist: abs val for: ch3och2=ch3+ch2o; curran recommendation; note that the rate is for dissociation 
tpgme-8 => pgcc*c + cocc2oj           6.818e+16 -1.34 2.693e+04     ! Yasunaga et al. CnF2011 for c2h5oc2h4p<=>c2h4+c2h5o
tpgme-9 = pgmecc2*o + c3h6oh                      1.60e+13 0.00  2.542e+04 !anist: abs val for: ch3och2=ch3+ch2o; curran recommendation; note that the rate is for dissociation 
tpgme-11 => hocc*oc + cocc2oj + c3h6               1.60e+13 0.00  2.542e+04 !anist: abs val for: ch3och2=ch3+ch2o; curran recommendation; note that the rate is for dissociation 
