pgcc(c)oj => ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6oh                 1.60e+13 0.00 2.542e+04          !anist: abs val for: ch3och2=ch3+ch2o; curran recommendation; note that the rate is for dissociation 
cocc2oj => ch2o + ch3cho + ch3                      1.60e+13 0.00 2.542e+04          !anist: abs val for: ch3och2=ch3+ch2o; curran recommendation; note that the rate is for dissociation 
