! pgmecc2*o, 2-(2-methoxypropoxy)propanal
! abstraction of ether hs.  use primary ether rate rule (from dme).  deg=7 for 7 ether hs.
! assume one set of products, if primary ether h is abstracted. use 7/6 of dme rate.
