!reaction class 28:  decomposition of carbonylhydroperoxide to form oxygenated radical species and oh

! rate rule sarathy et al., 2011
! most important ketohydroperoxides should be from 6-membered ring ro2 isomerizations.  Products from these cases estimated with most carefully.
! use product methyl-2-oxoacetate (me2*o) rather than acetic formic anhydride. me2*o is an isomer which also has two carbonyl and one ether group:
tpgme-ket1-3 => me2*o + ch2o + c3h6 + ch3cho + ch2oh + oh      1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04 
tpgme-ket1-4 => me2*o + ch2o + c3h6 + ch3cho + ch2oh + oh      1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket1-3
tpgme-ket1-5 =>  mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh            1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket4-5 

! tertiary: no weak h to abstract: (need to include alternative pathways)
!tpgme-ket3-1 => 
!tpgme-ket3-4 => 
!tpgme-ket3-5 => 
!tpgme-ket3-7 => 
!tpgme-ket3-8 => 
!tpgme-ket3-9 => 

tpgme-ket4-1 =>  mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh            1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket4-5
tpgme-ket4-3 =>  mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh            1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket4-5
!should be produced fairly fast. oh reacts with methyl group followed by 6 membered ring isomerization:
! product is 2-methoxymalonaldehyde not methyl 3-oxopropanoate (mp3*o).  but mp3*o is an isomer and also has 2 carbonyl groups and an ether group
! this avoids an additional species and its associated consumption reactions:
tpgme-ket4-5 => mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh             1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04
tpgme-ket4-7 =>  mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh            1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket4-5

tpgme-ket5-1 => me2*o + ch2o + c3h6 + ch3cho + ch2oh + oh      1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket1-3
tpgme-ket5-3 =>  me2*o + ch2o + c3h6 + ch3cho + ch2oh + oh     1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket1-3
tpgme-ket5-4 =>  mp3*o + ch3cho + ch2o + c3h6 + 2oh            1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket4-5
