tpgme-ket5-7 => o*c(c)coc(c)coh + co2 + ch3cho + ch3 + oh      1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04
tpgme-ket5-8 => o*c(c)coc(c)coh + co2 + ch3cho + ch3 + oh      1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    ! assume same products as tpgme-ket3-7
tpgme-ket5-9 => hoc3h6ocho + hcohco + c3h6 + ch3o + oh         1.0e+16 0.0 3.90e+04    !  assume same products as tpgme-ket8-9             
              
